Z||000023||DaRkLoRD||09-15-2001||09:08 PM||||Maybe it's cause I got there late (2pm) or if it was because of the delays at the border preventing many Americans from coming up.. but I found the show to be a lot smaller than laet years.. I only took a few pictures, mostly of custom work (including a really nice airdam on a green coupe, I'll post another topic about this when I get my pics developed)<P>I stopped and said hi to Jay, and checked out his Northstar GT.. if you have never heard a Northstar Fiero before, YOU ARE MISSING OUT.. sounds incredible!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>------------------<BR>    <A HREF="mailto:steve@fieroproject.com">steve@fieroproject.com</A>    <BR><A HREF="http://www.fieroproject.com" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fieroproject.com</A>||||reg||1
